abstract: >-
  Plans, locks and freeze manifests, first and second (recount) programs, result files,
  verification record and presubmission review record of a preregistered study of tracker
  covariances as safety margins for motion planning, in simulation (open loop and closed loop)
  and on recorded driving logs. The per-decision arrays are in the accompanying archive.
